TRY IT.
======
 
    As a guest, you'll be given a role that won't interfere with the 
ongoing drama, yet let's you watch all that's going on, like a fly on the
wall. In fact that's exactly what you'll be for the next few minutes.

   You'll be able to move through the world freely, and if a show is 
currently playing, get a feeling for what Interactive Theatre is all about.
Once inside, type Control-i for information on using the system. Note,
a system capable of VT100 terminal emulation is required.

   Do enjoy, and we'll see you back here shortly.
